# Pairs with NoEarlyGraceRelease. Defect #5719: the tenant-policy epoch grain
# ended its grace as soon as every member membership did not report dead had
# leased, skipping dead members at once. A silo falsely declared dead may still
# trust a lease from the previous activation, so the mutant releases the grace
# while that lease is live.
MODULE: ReleaseGraceSkipsDead
TARGET: NoEarlyGraceRelease
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the grace skips members membership reports dead without waiting out their leases
PERTURBS: ReleaseGrace
BOUNDS: NumSilos = 1, MaxRestarts = 1, MaxFalseDeaths = 1

--- FIND
    /\ \A t \in Silos : ~awaiting[t] /\ (LeasedHere(t) \/ (MemberDead(t) /\ seen[t] = "aged"))
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a dead member counts at once.
    /\ \A t \in Silos : ~awaiting[t] /\ (LeasedHere(t) \/ MemberDead(t))
--- END
